# Falsifiability (round-3 H-04/J-B3): two active grants on ONE ORIGIN with DIFFERENT
# checkouts are exactly the deployed-prohibited state the old checkout-joined query
# missed — the origin-keyed query must violate.
@prefix ciops: <https://oip.law/ontology/ci-ops#> .
ciops:g1 a ciops:SeatGrant ; ciops:hasGrantState ciops:ActiveGrant ;
    ciops:hasOriginKey "same-origin" .
ciops:g2 a ciops:SeatGrant ; ciops:hasGrantState ciops:ActiveGrant ;
    ciops:hasOriginKey "same-origin" .
